# --- BACKUPS OF PERSONAL STATE ---
# Every rule above is a hand-written denylist entry, so a backup of an ignored
# file is NOT itself ignored (the E2E audit caught exactly this: a .bak of the
# gitignored brain ledger showed up untracked and publishable). Blanket-ignore
# the backup/temp suffixes anywhere in the tree.
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig

